round trip equal          true
s1, s2 equal              false
s1 in s1's transaction    true
s1 before s2              true
s2 before s1              false
term_to_stamp c            Basic.Nuprl5_Exception(_) (stamp term invalid op)
term_to_stamp pid number   Basic.Nuprl5_Exception(_) (stamp term invalid pid)
term_to_stamp tseq token   Basic.Nuprl5_Exception(_) (stamp term invalid transaction)
term_to_stamp seq token    Basic.Nuprl5_Exception(_) (stamp term invalid sequence)
term_to_stamp a subterm    Basic.Nuprl5_Exception(_) (stamp term invalid term)
